 Summary
The AI Interview Coach is a well-architected system that balances simplicity with functionality. Its layered design allows for clear separation of concerns, while timeout protection and fallback mechanisms ensure reliability. The use of LangGraph provides a maintainable and scalable foundation for future enhancements.

Key Strengths:
•	Modular design with clear responsibilities
•	Resilient to external service failures
•	Scalable stateless API
•	Excellent user experience with sequential questions
•	Comprehensive error handling
•	Ready for production deployment
